{% comment %}
  modules/accela_construct/queries/records/documents/categories/build

  Builds the request path for GET /v4/records/{recordId}/documentCategories.

  Params:
    object - Hash with `record_id` (see documents/categories.liquid)

  Returns object with `path` added.
{% endcomment %}

